& [Purpose]
  + install and assess the smallest current published Cantor executable pilot on EVO-X2 while preserving the historical Needle2 attention runtime and withholding autonomous workspace authority

& [ProfilesAndShapes]
  + deployment_manifest12 artifact6 remote_receipt24 replay8 refusal4 protected_roots3 allowed_executions2 maximum_files128

& [Requirements]
  + [ECHP-001] bind the exact source snapshot custody commit bookend canonical signature conversation and published implementation lineage
  + [ECHP-002] operate from the clean D:/crf implementation surface and refuse C:/Project/Cantor Pinky other worktrees stashes or untracked recovery state
  + [ECHP-003] require local HEAD fetched canonical ref and direct remote ref equality before fresh release build packaging and live deployment
  + [ECHP-004] target only SSH alias evo-x2 host name EVO-X2 and final root C:/AI/services/cantor-current-pilot-48479932 under a closed Windows path grammar
  + [ECHP-005] preserve C:/AI/services/cantor-attention-mcp C:/AI/services/cantor-needle-runtime C:/AI/services/sop-agent and existing llama.cpp executable model command listener process identities as protected observations
  + [ECHP-006] install no Rust Python package model toolchain dependency service scheduled task startup hook environment PATH registry firewall port proxy or security policy
  + [ECHP-007] freshly build only selected current release binaries from the exact published checkout with locked offline dependencies and warnings-denied checks
  + [ECHP-008] package the current cantor query executable current A8 independent evidence verifier exact retained A8 evidence and only explicitly admitted public compatibility fixtures/support
  + [ECHP-009] deployment manifest has exactly12 ordered fields artifact entries6 fields artifact count at most128 per-file67108864 bytes aggregate1073741824 bytes and exact checked totals
  + [ECHP-010] normalized relative paths are bounded portable unique ordinal-ignore-case nonabsolute nontraversing nonempty visible ASCII and contain no colon wildcard control trailing dot or trailing space
  + [ECHP-011] manifest hashes exact compact UTF-8 typed ordered bytes under a fixed domain and enumerates every transferred file before transfer
  + [ECHP-012] refuse wrong host lineage ref root collision staging collision symlink junction reparse nonregular missing extra duplicate reordered oversized or digest-mismatched artifacts
  + [ECHP-013] install through one unique sibling staging root verify all bytes there and atomically rename only when the final root is absent and membership is exact
  + [ECHP-014] never merge overwrite repair in place or delete the final root; cleanup may remove only a newly created exact resolved staging root after containment proof
  + [ECHP-015] execute only fixed command vectors selected by allowed_executions values a8_evidence_replay and optional_cantor_public_query_replay
  + [ECHP-016] run the current A8 independent evidence verifier exactly twice in fresh processes against the in-root retained directory and require exit0 passed status byte-identical stdout and unchanged inputs/executable
  + [ECHP-017] provider requests for A8 replay are exactly zero and no A8 input output or error promotes endpoint broker permit activation preparation or execution authority
  + [ECHP-018] optional current cantor query runs at most once only after copied public fixture hashes command compatibility and all resolved dependency reads remain inside the pilot root; otherwise emit skipped_incompatible
  + [ECHP-019] remote receipt has exactly24 ordered fields replay entries8 fields bounded non-echo refusal and a fixed-domain self-digest
  + [ECHP-020] record package bytes install duration replay duration output bytes output SHA256 exit status determinism optional query result and observational host facts without universal performance inference
  + [ECHP-021] independently verify retrieved manifest receipt and output files locally without SSH provider network Git mutation service control or reads outside the supplied evidence directory
  + [ECHP-022] protected roots provider executable/model/config process command listener identities are unchanged before and after execution; configuration_changed=false listener_delta=0 persistent_process_count=0
  + [ECHP-023] errors and refusals expose only bounded code phase field and safe summary without echoing rejected path secret credential command endpoint or payload values
  + [ECHP-024] default implementation and adversarial tests are host-free and provider-free; only an explicitly invoked live script may perform bounded SSH transfer execution and receipt retrieval
  + [ECHP-025] exact focused tests locked-offline release build workspace warnings-denied Clippy format formation evidence attribution publication equality and immediate bookends precede live completion
  + [ECHP-026] retain live evidence in a new local experiment directory with exact manifest preflight install receipt replay outputs final audit and independent verification identities
  + [ECHP-027] claim only current Windows executable portability deterministic A8 contract replay measured durations and preserved-state observation; do not claim production trust autonomy semantic quality or self-assembly
  + [ECHP-028] plan-only build-job compilation is the next decision; remote source build workspace mutation commit push self-update private permit broker activation distributed scheduling FPGA OneDrive and Minecraft remain outside

& [Acceptance]
  + [ECHP-A01] source-bound SJS artifacts signature matrix phase lock and independent formation tests agree and are published before live effects
  + [ECHP-A02] local build package and remote installed membership match exact published lineage byte counts and SHA256 before and after both replays
  + [ECHP-A03] two fresh A8 evidence replays pass exit zero and return byte-identical canonical output with zero provider requests
  + [ECHP-A04] optional query truthfully passes or is skipped_incompatible without fixture alteration external dependency resolution or provider coercion
  + [ECHP-A05] protected deployments and provider identities remain unchanged and no pilot process listener service or startup registration remains
